### 1. Register a New User
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "PyCharm User",
  "email": "pycharm.test@example.com",
  "password": "securepassword123"
}

### 2. Login User (This automatically saves the JWT token for subsequent requests)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "pycharm.test@example.com",
  "password": "securepassword123"
}

> {% client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.data.access_token); %}

### 3. Get Current Logged-in User Profile
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 4. Fetch User Dashboard Statistics
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
